00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:51,000
Evil in ink.

2
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:36,000
The Tattooist is a horror, thriller film directed by Peter Burger.

3
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:21,000
American tattoo artist Jake Sawyer wanders the world, exploring
and exploiting ethnic themes in his tattoo designs.

4
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:06,000
At a tattoo expo in Singapore, he gets his first glimpse at the exotic world of traditional Samoan
tattoo (tatau), and, in a thoughtless act, unwittingly unleashes a powerful angry spirit.

5
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:51,000
In his devastating journey into Pacific mysticism, Jake must find a way
to save his new love, Sina and recover his own soul.

6
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:36,000
Jake Sawyer, played by Jason Behr.

7
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:21,000
Sina, played by Mia Blake.

8
