Mr. Va'a, played by David Fane.

9
00:51:45,000 --> 00:51:51,000
Alipati, played by Robbie Magasiva.

10
00:57:30,000 --> 00:57:36,000
Victoria, played by Caroline Cheong.

11
01:03:15,000 --> 01:03:21,000
Crash, played by Michael Hurst.

12
01:09:00,000 --> 01:09:06,000
The Tattooist is a 2007 New Zealand horror film directed by Peter Burger and starring
Jason Behr, Nathaniel Lees, Michael Hurst and Robbie Magasiva among others.

13
01:14:45,000 --> 01:14:51,000
The film is the first in a series of official
co-productions between New Zealand and Singapore.

14
01:20:30,000 --> 01:20:36,000
The film explores themes of singapore, new zealand, mystic, evil spirit, ghost.

15
01:26:15,000 --> 01:26:21,000
The tone is dark and intense.
